{"product": {"id": 6236632383676, "title": "Cortech Kangaroo Cart Lid", "body_html": "<p>The <strong>Cortech Kangaroo Cart Lid</strong> covers the Cortech Kangaroo All Purpose Delivery Cart (sold separately), for laundry, trash, and material handling in correctional, healthcare, and other high-abuse settings.</p>\n<p>The lid is made in the same three materials and colors as the cart: flame retardant, general use, and 100% recycled. Choose the lid that matches your cart.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Fit:</strong> Made for the Cortech Kangaroo Cart</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Material Options:</strong> Flame retardant, general use, or 100% recycled (Repro Black)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Colors:</strong> Blue Gray, Green, Blue, Gray, White, or Repro Black (custom colors available on request)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Country of Manufacture:</strong> USA, made to ISO quality standards</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Available Models and Options</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Flame Retardant:</strong> CC200L - Blue Gray, CC783L - Green, CC680L - Blue</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>General Use:</strong> CC280L - Gray, CC720L - Green, CC620L - Blue, CC2L - White</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>100% Recycled Material:</strong> CC116L - Repro Black</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<p>The Kangaroo Cart lid suits facilities that want to cover laundry, trash, or supplies in a Kangaroo Cart.</p>\n<p>Typical applications include:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Laundry collection and delivery in correctional facilities, hospitals, and behavioral healthcare facilities</li>\n  <li>Trash and recycling collection</li>\n  <li>Janitorial work and general material handling</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Explore Anchortex's <a href=\"https://www.anchortex.com/collections/janitorial-and-sanitation-supplies\">Prison Janitorial and Sanitation Supplies</a> and <a href=\"https://www.anchortex.com/collections/bh-laundry-carts\">Hospital Laundry Carts and Heavy Duty Basket Trucks</a> collections for more carts and sanitation supplies.</p>\n<h2>About Cortech Facilities Maintenance</h2>\n<p>Cortech facilities maintenance products are molded to stand up to hard daily use in correctional facilities, behavioral healthcare facilities, and other high-abuse settings.</p>\n<p>Cortech facilities maintenance includes:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Trash Receptacles:</strong> Cobra Cans in 20 to 55 gallon sizes, in flame retardant or food grade and general use material, and Cobra Mini Cans in 10 and 14 quart sizes</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Can Dollies:</strong> Cobra Can dollies in two sizes</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Carts:</strong> Kangaroo Carts and lids for laundry, trash, and material handling</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>About Cortech</h2>\n<p>Cortech manufactures durable molded furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, correctional institutions, law enforcement facilities, and homeless and emergency shelters. Explore the full line of <a href=\"https://www.anchortex.com/collections/cortech-usa\">Cortech Behavioral Health and Prison Furniture</a> at Anchortex.</p>", "vendor": "Cortech", "product_type": "", "created_at": "2021-01-29T16:10:05-05:00", "handle": "cortech-cc200l-lid-for-kangaroo-cart", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T11:37:50-05:00", "published_at": "2021-01-29T16:10:05-05:00", "template_suffix": null, "published_scope": "web", "tags": "cortech-kitchen-food-service, cortech-usa, janitorial-prison-carts, kitchen-food-service, Laundry Carts and Hampers, prison-janitorial", "variants": [{"id": 37962709237948, "product_id": 6236632383676, "title": "CC116L - Black Repro Material", "price": "284.80", "sku": "C601646-01", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "356.00", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": "shopify", "option1": "CC116L - Black Repro Material", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2021-01-29T16:10:07-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T11:37:50-05:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "-", "grams": 9072, "image_id": null, "weight": 20.0, "weight_unit"